            "review_title": "Review at Bep Viet Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Dan\nLondon, England, United Kingdom21 contributions\n0\nExceptional value and service. You won’t be disappointed.\nJan 2026 • Couples\nEnormous portions of fried shrimp, fried catfish (exceptionally good), shrimp-fried rice, green beans with garlic and snail spring rolls. Friendly cat too. Extraordinarily helpful staff especially Bui Duc Dong. Great value.\nWritten January 17, 2026",
