            "reviewer_id": "User_p1_1",
            "review_title": "Review at Bep Viet Restaurant",
            "review_text": "debbie tran\nSan Jose, California10 contributions\n0\nAmazing staff, Delicious food!\nDec 2025 • Family\nBep Viet Restaurant in Ha Giang holds a special place in my heart as one of the first restaurants I visited in this small city. Recommended by nearly everyone I met, it quickly became a regular spot for my sister and me, and we ended up coming for dinner almost every day during our stay.\n\nOur favorite dish is the baked fish, though the menu offers a wide variety of options that allow you to sample many flavors. The ingredients are fresh, and each dish is thoughtfully prepared, with a careful balance of flavors that truly captures the essence of Vietnamese cuisine.\n\nStrongly recommend !\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten December 7, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
